# Local working notes: the design record behind the tool and the outfit mod, not
# part of what ships. Kept on disk deliberately - read it before changing either.
PORTRAIT_TOOL_PRD.md

# Test artifact, rewritten by every `node test_tool.mjs` run.
test_zip.zip

# Exports land here if you unzip them in place. FarmerOutfitsPortraitsSync/ is NOT
# ignored - it ships, and is the one mod folder that lives in this repo.
FarmerPortraitsExample/
*.zip

# Maintainer notes: rationale, engine facts, verified behaviour. README.txt is
# the one that ships. NOTES_portrait_tool.md is the commentary that used to sit
# inside portrait_tool.html, lifted out so the download carries no dev notes.
NOTES.md
NOTES_portrait_tool.md

# The Nexus page, in their BBCode. It is a COPY of what is live, not the source:
# Sage edits the page in Nexus's own editor and pastes the result back here, so
# re-read this file before editing it rather than trusting an earlier read.
#
# It used to be the same words as README.md. As of 2026-08-16 the two are
# deliberately different documents and are NOT kept in sync: this one carries the
# AI disclosure (Nexus policy) and an update log; README.md carries neither,
# because GitHub releases hold the changelog. Shared feature wording is still
# worth keeping aligned - the structure is not.
NEXUS_page.bbcode

# The Nexus API key. release.mjs reads it from the NEXUS_API_KEY environment
# variable and never from a file, so this is a place to keep it, not a place
# anything loads on its own - source it into the shell before `nexus --go`.
# Broad patterns on purpose: the cost of one of these reaching a public repo is
# a stranger publishing files under Sage's account.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.secret
